{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07148","headline":"送河南元判官赴河南句当苗税充百官俸钱 · 刘长卿","name":"送河南元判官赴河南句当苗税充百官俸钱","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春草长河曲，离心共渺然。\n方收汉家俸，独向汶阳田。\n鸟雀空城在，榛芜旧路迁。\n山东征战苦，几处有人烟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07148.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07148","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}